# Every Dockerfile here builds from the workspace root (the Go images need the shared
# vendor/ tree, the ui image needs both ui/ and ts-sdk/), so the context is the whole repo.
# These are the parts no image consumes — without them the daemon ships ~170MB of
# node_modules and git history on every build.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/bin
**/coverage
reviews
